         <title>
            TGScripts snapshot - 2026 Okt 24
         </title>
         <remove>
            src/scripts/TGScripts
            doc/scripts/AberrationInspectorTG
            doc/scripts/AberrationSpotterTG
            doc/scripts/BBStarReduction
            doc/scripts/ColorMaskTG
            doc/scripts/CSTG
