         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               SubframeQualityReview: Adds equal-weight correlation scoring, individual corner KPIs, and R3 ranking. Scores range from 0 to 1, with higher values indicating better quality. Automatically measures missing corners, reports included KPIs, improves the scoring layout, and defaults to using available guiding data.
            </p>
